This schema defines a beta cruiser with the following properties:

* `name`: a string representing the name of the cruiser
* `type`: a string representing the type of the cruiser
* `size`: a number representing the size of the cruiser
* `armament`: an array of objects, each representing a weapon on the cruiser, with the following properties:
	+ `weapon`: a string representing the type of weapon
	+ `caliber`: a number representing the caliber of the weapon
	+ `[special feature]`: a string representing any special feature of the weapon (this is a placeholder, represented by square brackets)
* `speed`: a number representing the speed of the cruiser
* `range`: a number representing the range of the cruiser

Note that the `[special feature]` property is a placeholder, and you would replace it with a real property name when defining your schema.

